# adb-meowarch install hook

post_install() {
    cat <<'MSG'
adb-meowarch: run `adb-meowarch` (the distro's `adb` from android-tools is
  left untouched, so both can be installed side by side).
  mDNS discovery (adb connect by service name / wireless pairing discovery) is
  not built in: use `adb-meowarch connect IP:PORT` with the address from the
  device's wireless-debugging screen instead.
  USB works like platform-tools; if `adb-meowarch devices` is empty but lsusb
  sees the phone, install udev rules (AUR: android-udev) or run as root.
MSG
}
